DTSTAMP:20261010T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261016T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261016T180000
SUMMARY:Bruce Cheves Day and Ringing of the Bell
LOCATION:Destin Harbor docks behind AJ's Seafood & Oyster Bar\, 116 Harbor 
 Blvd\, Destin\, FL 32541
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/16 · 5:00 PM\n\nThe City of Destin has declared Octo
 ber 16 Bruce Cheves Day\, and the Destin Fishing Rodeo marks it at the har
 bor docks with a celebration of the late weighmaster's 41 years at the sca
 le. At 5:00 PM the rodeo rings the bell for the people and legends the fis
 hing community lost this year. The rodeo's weigh-ins run on the same docks
  all month\, so the scale is usually busy.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\
 nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-destin-bruce-cheves-day-1
 016.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-destin-bruce-cheves-day-1016.htm
 l
CATEGORIES:Town and community
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
