  Ave\, Foley\, AL 36535
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/17 · 9:00 AM to 11:00 AM\n\nThe Foley Community Li
 brary hosts its third Touch-a-Truck\, where children climb around tractors
 \, backhoes\, bucket trucks and other big machines. Foley's fire\, police\
 , public works and street departments bring vehicles\, and Maynard Family 
 Farms brings a petting zoo. A local musician plays live\, and Kona Ice and
  ReNew Coffee Truck sell treats and drinks.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: htt
 ps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-big-rigs-at-the-library-foley-touch-a-
