 78
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/17 · 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM\n\nThe Niceville Bazaar s
 ets up vendor booths and food trucks on the Mullet Festival Grounds for on
 e Saturday in October\, and admission is free for every age. The event ben
 efits Freedom Life Compass\, so browsing the tables supports that organiza
 tion directly. It runs from 10 AM to 4 PM\, plenty of time to walk the who
 le grounds.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events
 /ev-niceville-bazaar-1017.html
