SUMMARY:Spirits of Crestview Guided Stroll
LOCATION:Main Street\, Downtown Crestview\, Main Street\, Crestview\, FL 32
 536
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 10/22 · 6:00 PM to 9:00 PM\n\nThe mayor's cultural pr
 ogram turns Main Street into a living museum where costumed guides introdu
 ce figures from Crestview's history\, including the owner of a local Coney
  Island stand and the city's first librarian. Tour groups leave every 15 m
 inutes from 6:00 PM and the last group departs at 7:45 PM\, and each walk 
 takes 45 minutes to an hour. Space in each group is limited\, so a spot ha
 s to be booked ahead.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-spirits-of-crestview-walking-tour-1022.html
